Subject: arm64: qcom: add OPD2515 diagnostic baseline

This patch captures the out-of-tree diagnostic kernel state used by the
OPD2515 experiments through EXP-056. It applies to Linux commit
6a876df4686788cd39128b62d7fcbff62f39278f (v7.4-rc1).

The patch is not an upstream submission. Some changes are deliberately
diagnostic, OPD2515-specific, and unsafe for other devices.

